title: TPMS Tire Temperature Display Enable
raw_community_title: TPMS - Display tire temperature in addition to tire pressure
category: Cluster and Displays
platform: Ranger (6G)
model_years: 2024+
trim: All
source_sheet: (2024+) 6G Ranger.xlsx
notes: 'Can use FORScan Easy Mode

  FORScan Menu: Tire Temperature Display (Disabled (Default), Enabled)

  Trim: All [Confirmed: jezzzza (9/12/2024) Raptor]'
steps:
- module: IPC
  address: 720-11-01
  notes: 'Suggest to use the non-asbuilt menu to change

    * -> Bit 4 (Add 8 to enable, e.g. change 2 to A)

    FORScan Menu: Tire Temperature Display (Disabled (Default), Enabled)

    Trim: All [Confirmed: jezzzza (9/12/2024) Raptor]'
  targets:
  - mask: xxxx *xxx xx--
    offset_hint: '+8'
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 3
      action: 1
      feature: Tire Temperature Display (TTD)
recipe_version: '1.1'
